7,1,1,talk,Servas,,I value clarity. I will examine the invoices for outside hire and the final clear-out of the old fridge.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I want to see the quotes for the two fit-outs and the partition wall! Numbers first, please!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
