35,2,1,talk,May,,"@Misaki, twenty-five minutes for lunch is brutal. Plus, three keyboards are basically composting. We need a real kitchen, not just a break room.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@May, the data shows the two nearest the door used it eleven times. The rest only four. It’s not overburdened, just concentrated.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Misaki, concentration is a form of neglect. I found 68,000 yen paid for small groups, and a fridge cleared by one person twice.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"@May, the wall is basically paper! I can hear everything. Plus, the kitchen quote is ninety-six thousand yen. That’s a lot!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, paper walls explain the awkwardness! The last hard talk happened in front of everyone. We need privacy, not just a kitchen.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, privacy is great, but I’m starving. If we can’t eat here, I’m walking twenty-five minutes every day.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, the callouts show no noise issues, just equipment faults. The room isn’t broken, just underused by most.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, the hours vanish into invisible labor. I saw one person clear the fridge twice. We must stop paying for what we should share.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, sixty-eight thousand yen? Ouch! And the screen setup is one hundred forty-one thousand. We really need to look at these numbers carefully before signing anything!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, that’s a lot of money for invisible work. But if we’re strangers, maybe we need a quiet corner to actually talk, not just clear fridges.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, so it’s just two people hogging it? That explains the mess. I’m not walking twenty-five minutes daily, I refuse.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, it’s not about hogging. It’s about proximity. The two nearest the door use it most because they are closest.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
